OL,3,GNEWSALockerbie bombing intended 'to
OL,4,Ainflict pain and horror', US court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe bombing of an American airliner
OL,7,Fover Lockerbie 37 years ago was
OL,8,Fintended to inflict "pain and horror,"
OL,9,Fa judge has been told.
OL,11,FThe US government made the claim as it
OL,12,Fargued that relatives of the victims
OL,13,Fshould be allowed to give evidence
OL,14,Fduring the trial of a Libyan suspect.
OL,16,FProsecutors believe their testimony
OL,17,Fwill help the jury understand the
OL,18,Fimpact of the attack, which killed 270
OL,19,Fpeople on December 21, 1988.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
